# Found It Software — founditsoftware.com
# Names only. Copy what you need into .env.local (git-ignored) and fill it in
# there; production values live in Vercel. Never put a real value in this file.

# ─── /list gate: SMS one-time code (Twilio Verify) ───
# Used by src/app/api/list/verify/route.ts. All three must be set for the
# gate to text a code. If ANY is missing the route answers
# { ok: true, skipped: true } and the gate degrades to cell-only: no text is
# sent, the lead still posts to /api/lead, and the trail carries no
# "Phone verified by SMS code." note.
# Twilio Verify sends from Twilio's own pre-registered channels, so it does
# not depend on 10DLC/A2P registration for the marketing number.

# Twilio Console → Account Info → Account SID (starts with "AC")
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
# Twilio Console → Account Info → Auth Token
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
# Twilio Console → Verify → Services → your service's SID (starts with "VA")
TWILIO_VERIFY_SERVICE_SID=
